  "keyFeatures": [
    "Six-status build pipeline (pre-ordered → complete) with a Home dashboard showing the bench, backlog, and mail",
    "Orders that fan out into individual kit rows — one physical kit per row, not a quantity",
    "Four inventory catalogs (tools, consumables, upgrade parts, display gear) with low-stock thresholds",
    "Retailer report cards with rating, packing quality, and shipping speed",
    "Full CSV import/export with preview-before-commit and merge/replace modes",
    "Built-in MCP server on the same process — no separate service to run",
    "MCP OAuth for passwordless Claude web and ChatGPT web integration in OIDC mode",
    "Password login or OpenID Connect (Google, Keycloak, Authentik) authentication",
    "Personal access tokens with read-only or read-write scope",
    "Four tested deployment paths: local, LAN/mesh, Cloudflare Tunnel, VPS + Caddy",
    "Light/dark/system theme per browser",
    "Internationalisation with locale, time zone, currency, and date-style settings"
  ],
